Additional terms of use
-----------------------

The data consists of responses written by K-12 students in routine classroom
assessment, collected under educational governance and privacy protections.
Identifiers were removed and responses were anonymised before annotation.
Question identifiers in the release are anonymised.

By using this dataset you agree to:

1. Use it for research on short-answer scoring and related educational NLP,
   not to identify or attempt to re-identify any student, teacher, class or
   school.
2. Not redistribute it in a form that reverses the anonymisation.
3. Treat models trained on it as tools that support instructional practice,
   not as replacements for expert human judgment, and to report bias, fairness
   and interpretability considerations when deploying or publishing on them.

If you believe any record contains residual personal information, please
contact the authors so it can be removed.

